    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_058"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "All these corpses... have started to rot."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "They're W's men. A bunch of mercenary devils."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "This makes no sense. We haven't done anything to these guys. They were lynched, and clearly they were killed off in secret."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_059"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?",
        "text": "When did all this internal cleanup begin anyway?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_058"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "No idea. My guess is it happened within the last few days."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "One thing is clear, though. Talulah's been planning this for a long time. Damn it. I can't believe we didn't even see through her facade until it was too late. She really strung us along, that monster!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_059"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?",
        "text": "Regardless of whether they willingly obeyed her or not, it was Talulah who ordered the Sarkaz mercenaries to fight us. So is there a point to killing them off? What is she even trying to accomplish? Setting an example?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?",
        "text": "No, I doubt it... No one can threaten even a lone Sarkaz, let alone a whole group of them."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_058"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "Yeah, that's right. They do say that the devils will kill whoever that dares threaten them, and if you ask me, the ones we have in the guerrillas are living proof of that."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_059"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?",
        "text": "That makes no sense, then. If these guys were killed because they stuck with W, then whose side is W on?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "??? ",
        "text": "Well, maybe you'd like to take a little guess? I just might give you a little something if you get it right."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_058"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "Stop where you are! Put your hands up!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "\u2014!"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_046#2",
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "??? ",
        "text": "Now, now. Let's not be hasty. Keep your weapons to yourselves. Wow. That's a big sword. New blood from Rhodes Island, I presume?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_059"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?",
        "text": "...W...!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?",
        "text": "It was you... You are the one who killed Scout!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "Is that her?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "Then I'll avenge Mr. Scout!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_046#5"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "What are you talking about?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "Hold on, time out. White kitty, you can kill me all you want, and I'll admit to anything I've done, but I'm not gonna take the fall for something I didn't do."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "And I gotta remind the Rhodes Island boy in Reunion cosplay over there..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "Yeah, I can tell it's you. I remember you. Let me make this clear: I let you get away. Think about it, what good would it even do for me, turning you in to the old man?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_046#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "Scout died for Rhodes Island. I took his life only because I didn't have a choice."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "Listen up. He could easily have gotten out of that without so much as a scratch. He just decided to put on a show with me for the Reunion folks to keep you and the others alive."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "You think I wanted to kill him? Forget the fact he's a Sarkaz, you really think I would kill one of the last Sarkaz stealth masters left, one of the best elite marksmen out there, and, above all, the guy who could've been the next Kazdel hero?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_059"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?",
        "text": "Liar!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_046#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "What are you going off on me for?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_046#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 0.4,
            "xstrength": 0,
            "ystrength": 8,
            "vibration": 30,
            "randomness": 30,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "You little shit, how dare you go off on me?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "You know what, now I'll really go off on you. If you were actually as good as you say, you could've killed the dragon lady right there, and we'd be dealing with a lot less dead people!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "Why else would I even kill Scout, someone I really respected?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "You think I'm some kind of a sellsword, don't you? Sure, I'll tell you. Yes. Yes, I am. It's true, but unlike you guys, I rank people by their worth."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "Scout was... And listen up! To me, he was worth more than anyone else, even back in Babel."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_046#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "I'd even say he's worth more than me."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "...So let me ask you again: what is it about you that's actually worthy of his sacrifice? Huh?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_059"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?",
        "text": "You..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_046#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "Ugh, ahem, pfft..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042",
            "name2": "avg_npc_046#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "Put your hands up, and put your weapon down. I don't believe you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042",
            "name2": "avg_npc_046#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "Look, I count myself plenty lucky that I wasn't burned to a crisp by Talulah or pinned against a wall and crushed to death by that monster Kal'tsit carries around."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "So, I seriously mean it, can't you just leave me alone? Having the bigger gun doesn't make what you say more righteous. Otherwise, I'd be the just about most righteous person here, what with how many people I've blown up."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "While we're at it, Kal'tsit said so herself. We're on the same side right now."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "I'm on your side."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "I even have a recording right here. Wanna take a listen?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042",
            "name2": "avg_npc_046#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "Why are you in such a rush?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042",
            "name2": "avg_npc_046#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "Huh? What, kid, do you read minds or something? Then how come you still don't believe me?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042",
            "name2": "avg_npc_046#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "Of course I'm in a rush! If I don't kill Talulah soon, everyone I care about is gonna die!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "The Sarkaz mercenaries have a fatal flaw. They don't ever give the situation any thought unless they're out to kill someone."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "Tell them to do something, and they'll do it, no questions asked. They don't care about themselves, and they don't care about other people's lives at all, let alone their own."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "My point is, if I don't go fetch them soon, they'll all be dead."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_058"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "You can convince them?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_046#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "Let's save that till Talulah's dead."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "Alright, you've wasted enough of my time already. Move aside, will you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_059"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_046#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "You, let me say just one thing."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "Make his death mean something."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_059"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?",
        "text": "\u2014\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?",
        "text": "Do I really have that right?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "You do."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_046#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "Yeah, you do. You're still around because of everything my old pals did."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_059"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?",
        "text": "...Ah...!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?",
        "text": "Fine, enough! Rosmontis, let her go!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "You mean she's telling the truth? She protected Amiya and everyone else?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_059"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?",
        "text": "Trust me, and trust her this once. Just this once."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_046#5"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "So I'm good to go?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_059"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?",
        "text": "...Scram!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?",
        "text": "Don't ever let me see you again."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?",
        "text": "\u2014Don't ever let me see you again!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_046#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "Well, thanks, and don't worry. If I screw this up, you sure as hell won't ever see me again."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "So, looks like they're fine with it. What do you say, guerrillas?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_058"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "The Captain told us you can't be trusted."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_046#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "I think the old boy's right. I've told way too many lies. Truths, too. It's definitely not easy to pick anything meaningful out of my words."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "I can't do anything about the way you guys see me, right?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "But no one wants to blow her up more than I do, I can promise you that."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "I'll also say this: you should stop staring at other people's backs so much. You don't get it. You have no idea just what went down with the devils."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "You have no idea what my mercenaries died for. So, don't you dare look at me like that."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "Ha. Did you people give the dragon lady that look too?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_058"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "\u2014\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "Going by your wounds, I can see you've already fought Talulah."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_046#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "Haha. Well, look at the eyes on this guy! Only took you about ten minutes."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "That's right. I fought her. And I lost."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_058"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "You're pretty heavily injured, you had your ass handed to you. What are you even hoping to accomplish?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_046#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "I'm alive. That's good enough. If the Rhodes Island bunny can't deal with her, then I'll give it another go and blow Talulah up again."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
