        }
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 0,
            "fadetime": 1.5,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "imagetween",
        "params": {
            "xscalefrom": 1.1,
            "yscalefrom": 1.1,
            "xscale": 1,
            "yscale": 1,
            "duration": 15,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "You don't stand a chance against her."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "If you want to die, suit yourself. We won't get in the way."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "Buddy, I know how to take detours. You know I do."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "I certainly didn't expect to see you guys running around with Rhodes Island, but I actually went out of my way to come meet you here. I'm here to save your lives."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "Have you seen the bodies of my poor brothers strewn all around the ground here? Take a good look."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "My brothers, there's more than just civilians and Reunion folks left in the city."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "The Ursus soldiers are wearing our clothes."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "We've come across them already, and we are more than rea\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "More than ready? Seriously?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Shieldguard",
        "text": "Go climb a tree."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "I'm just trying to tell you the truth, and you know I don't do that often. You better not be ready to die."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "If Talulah's doing all this, she clearly doesn't give a damn about Reunion at all. She wants Reunion to die right here."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "W",
        "text": "Anyway, this is where we say our goodbyes. If luck's on our side, maybe all of us will still be alive when this is over."
    },
    {
