    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "We're almost to the sarcophagus core."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "Are you worried about something?",
            "values": "1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "I'm worried I won't be able to protect you."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Actually, Dr. {@nickname}, there will come a day I won't be able to protect you."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "First, there's simply far more factions than anticipated fighting against each other. Their penchant for violence is no less destructive than the Catastrophes, and not only will that present unexpected problems, it will also bring with it deaths that we simply could not have anticipated."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Even if we knew everything, it doesn't necessarily mean we would be able to change everything. It's precisely this that gave rise to so many tragedies, and it's also the beginning of many journeys."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Secondly, Dr. {@nickname}..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Are you really worthy of my protection?"
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "Another one of your riddles?! ;......;You don't think I'm worth protecting, Dr. Kal'tsit?",
            "values": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "I'm just putting on some pressure with information asymmetry."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Of course, Cautuses will bite if it comes down to it."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "But if I just handed you the answer, it'd only make you be even more suspicious of the truth. You have to either fight for the truth yourself or wait for the answer to reveal itself."
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "You won't answer me."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "I can tell... After all, this is the person you used to be."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "But you aren't the same. Dr. {@nickname}, promise me you aren't the person you once were."
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 3
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Well."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Have I ever placed a curse on you, Dr. {@nickname}? You broke the curse, and now you're using it on me?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Whether you are worthy or not is not for me to decide."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Even if you aren't worthy, I will still do it. As for why, I suppose I will just have to tell you later on."
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "\u2014The Herd!"
    },
